# Molt Tender: "{T}, Exile a card from your graveyard: Add one mana of any color." Black Lotus, sacrificed for the {G} that casts
# the Tender on turn 1, is the card in Bot1's graveyard. On turn 3 the Tender taps and exiles it (Bot1 names the card) for one red
# mana, which pays for Lightning Bolt at Bot2: the Lotus is in exile, the Bolt in the graveyard, Bot2 at 17. It is a mana ability: it
# does not use the stack, and the Tender is tapped; it adds exactly one mana, not two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Molt Tender
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Molt Tender.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Activate(Ability: Exile a card; Color: Red)
Bot1.Choose(Black Lotus)
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 17
Exile = Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Molt Tender.Tapped = true
